WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.668
-Before we go on,
I'd like to take a moment

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:03.870
to thank some of our sponsors
for tonight's show.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.738
They don't always fit
in the commercial breaks,

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.007
and we want to make sure
we mention all of them.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.709
So it's time for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:10.776
Here we go.

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.513
-♪ "Tonight Show" sponsors ♪

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.950
♪ "Tonight Show" sponsors ♪

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.452
-Our first sponsor
is Spectrum --

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.754
we hear your complaints,
and we don't care.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.791
[ Applause ]

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:26.859
Head &amp; Shoulders --

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:30.496
let everyone who uses your
bathroom know you have dandruff.

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.699
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:33.699 --> 00:00:35.135
CNBC --

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.271
cornering the market in business
news and "Shark Tank" returns.

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.373
[ Applause ]

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.143
Guinness --

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.944
because sometimes
you're in the mood for

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.146
a tall, cold glass
of carbonated motor oil.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:49.682
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.720
Also sponsored by U-Haul --

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.588
think you can handle
driving a semi truck?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.990
No? Perfect.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.991
[ Applause ]

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:01.293
[ Squeaking ]

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:02.428
Cadbury --

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.364
we do creme eggs
for Halloween now.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.732
Just go with it.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.368
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.169
Cinemax --

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:12.471
whoa, don't freak out,
we came free with HBO.

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:15.208
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:18.644
Athleta --

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.813
if you squint, you could
pretend we're Lululemon.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:22.849
[ Applause ]

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.154
AT&amp;T --

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.324
sorry, -ou're cutting ou-,
-ould you -epeat tha-?

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.259
[ Applause ]

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.397
Oat milk --

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.831
honestly, we started this
as a joke,

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:40.700
and then the thing just
kinda blew up.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.669
[ Applause ]

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.304
Adidas --

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:47.607
the official track suit
for professional athletes

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.342
and background actors
in "The Sopranos" movie.

00:01:50.342 --> 00:01:51.845
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:55.548
Also, Coors Light --

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.816
okay, fine, we confess,

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.152
it's just as cold
as every other beer.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.320
[ Applause ]

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.389
And finally, "USA Today,"

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.591
because it's morning,
and you're in a hotel.

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.894
Well, that's all for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

